# Achieving True Power (battlefield.achieving_true_power#areas, Navukgo Execution Chamber): four chars, each a level 75
# Puppetmaster at level cap 75, Achieving True Power accepted at Quest[1][85]Prog 1 (GMs), one Puppetmaster's Testimony;
# one player to a battlefield. main enters area 1 (49), bob area 2 (50), cat area 3 (51), each by the testimony:
# TESTIMONY_WEARS (3 shown, 2 left). dan's trade with all three areas taken: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7277, no menu. bob's
# SHAMARHAAN+2 brought to 1 HP: in the kill step SHAMARHAAN_AUTOMATON_POWER, SHAMARHAAN_UNDERESTIMATED,
# SHAMARHAAN_MAGNIFICENT (his mob script) and 32001 (area 2); finished: the scroll, completed. cat's SHAMARHAAN+4: in
# the kill step the same three texts and 32001 (area 3); finished: the scroll, completed.
